msgid "You made it!"
msgstr "{crew|Du|Du|Dere} klarte det!"

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You reached {place} before the pirates! The people of {place} chase the pirates away, and give you"
" {silver} silver."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Du|Du|Dere} kom {place@to} før piratene! Folket {place@in} jager piratene bort og gir "
"{crew|deg|deg|dere} {silver} sølv."

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Caught!"
msgstr "Fanget!"

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The pirates caught you! They laugh, kiss the prow of your boat, and sail away. Try again?"
msgstr ""
"Piratene fanget {crew|deg|deg|dere}! De ler, kysser stavnen på båten {crew|din|din|deres} og "
"seiler bort. Prøve igjen?"

