#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/003_eggs_for_the_inn/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our hens lay more eggs than we can eat. Gudrun at the inn in Vargvik pays well for them. Load two "
"crates of eggs from the store and bring them to her."
msgstr ""
"Hønene våre legger flere egg enn vi klarer å spise. Gudrun på vertshuset i Vargvik betaler godt "
"for dem. Last to kasser egg fra lageret og ta dem med til henne."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/003_eggs_for_the_inn/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fresh eggs! The guests will have pancakes tomorrow. Here is your silver, and come again."
msgstr ""
"Ferske egg! Gjestene får pannekaker i morgen. Her er sølvet {crew|ditt|ditt|deres}, og kom gjerne "
"igjen."

