#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/004_the_sneezing_sheep/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our sheep sneezes and sneezes. Row to the island of Laxön and ask Tova the healer what helps."
msgstr "Sauen vår nyser og nyser. Ro til øya Laxön og spør helbrederen Tova hva som hjelper."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/004_the_sneezing_sheep/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A sneezing sheep? It has a cold. Thyme helps: here is a bundle. Steam it in warm water and let her"
" breathe it."
msgstr ""
"En sau som nyser? Den er forkjølet. Timian hjelper: her er en bunt. Legg den i varmt vann og la "
"sauen puste inn dampen."

