msgid "News on the Water"
msgstr "Nytt på vannet"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A good trader asks before she sells. Hail three boats on the lakes and ask about the price of "
"wool. Then sell a crate of wool where it pays."
msgstr ""
"En god handelskvinne spør før hun selger. Hils på tre båter på innsjøene og spør om prisen på ull."
" Selg så en kasse ull der det lønner seg."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now you know more than most traders! Sell your wool where they want it."
msgstr "Nå vet {crew|du|du|dere} mer enn de fleste handelsfolk! Selg ulla der de vil ha den."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Wool? They always need it at the weaver in Guldvik."
msgstr "Ull? Det trenger de alltid hos veversken i Guldvik."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The market in Kråkhamn buys wool too, they say."
msgstr "Markedet i Kråkhamn kjøper også ull, sier de."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Good soft wool! I will spin it into yarn and weave it into cloth. Thank you."
msgstr ""
"God, myk ull! Jeg skal spinne den til garn og veve den til tøy. Takk skal {crew|du|du|dere} ha."

