#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/007_the_swan_in_the_net/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A swan is caught in an old net in the reeds by my farm. She can not fly! My shears are blunt. "
"Fetch sharp shears from Hrafn the smith in Gäddarby, quick."
msgstr ""
"En svane har satt seg fast i et gammelt garn i sivet ved gården min. Hun kan ikke fly! Saksa mi er"
" sløv. Hent ei skarp saks hos smeden Hrafn i Gäddarby, fort."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/007_the_swan_in_the_net/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "For a swan? Take my best shears, and bring them back some day."
msgstr "Til en svane? Ta den beste saksa mi, og ta den med tilbake en dag."

