#: data/missions/012_who_takes_the_honey/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Every night, a pot of honey is gone from my hives! Who takes it? Ask Old Halvard the ferryman, he "
"sees everything on the lakes."
msgstr ""
"Hver natt forsvinner en krukke honning fra bikubene mine! Hvem tar den? Spør gamle ferjemann "
"Halvard, han ser alt på innsjøene."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/012_who_takes_the_honey/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey? Ha! I saw paw prints on the shore by Svanetorp. Small ones. Ask Old Grim there."
msgstr "Honning? Ha! Jeg så poteavtrykk på stranda ved Svanetorp. Små. Spør gamle Grim der."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/012_who_takes_the_honey/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Paw prints? Look in my woodshed... a bear cub, sticky with honey! His mother must be in the woods "
"by Hjortingsala. Take him to her, gently."
msgstr ""
"Poteavtrykk? Se i vedskjulet mitt... en bjørnunge, klissete av honning! Mora hans må være i skogen"
" ved Hjortingsala. Ta ham med til henne, forsiktig."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/012_who_takes_the_honey/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "He is asleep in the basket. Row quietly!"
msgstr "Han sover i kurven. Ro stille!"

