msgid "The Market Day"
msgstr "Markedsdag"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/014_the_market_day/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The great market day is soon! The first trader with new honey and goat's cheese gets the best "
"place. Gunnhild from the Long Lake wants it too. Can you beat her?"
msgstr ""
"Den store markedsdagen kommer snart! Den første som kommer med ny honning og geitost, får den "
"beste plassen. Gunnhild fra Langsjøen vil ha den også. Klarer {crew|du|du|dere} å slå henne?"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/014_the_market_day/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Two crates of honey! Now the cheese."
msgstr "To kasser honning! Nå osten."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/014_the_market_day/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Honey and cheese, and before Gunnhild! She laughs and says: next time I win. I think you two will "
"be friends."
msgstr ""
"Honning og ost, og før Gunnhild! Hun ler og sier: neste gang vinner jeg. Jeg tror {crew|dere "
"to|dere to|dere|dere} blir venner."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/014_the_market_day/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "On market days, traders came from far away; the best stalls went to the first."
msgstr "På markedsdagene kom handelsfolk langveisfra; de beste bodene gikk til de første."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/015_the_sick_calf/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Sick Calf"
msgstr "Den syke kalven"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/015_the_sick_calf/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The calf of our cow does not drink. Tova says she needs chamomile and a warm stone in her bed. The"
" chamomile is with Tova, the stones are hot in Dagny's kiln on Bergö."
msgstr ""
"Kalven til kua vår vil ikke drikke. Tova sier hun trenger kamille og en varm stein i senga si. "
"Kamillen har Tova, og steinene ligger varme i brennovnen til Dagny på Bergö."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/015_the_sick_calf/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Chamomile calms her tummy. Give it with warm water."
msgstr "Kamille roer magen hennes. Gi den med varmt vann."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/015_the_sick_calf/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hot from the kiln, wrapped in wool. It stays warm all night."
msgstr "Varm fra ovnen, pakket inn i ull. Den holder seg varm hele natta."

