#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cheese keeps the milk of the summer for the winter."
msgstr "Osten tar vare på sommerens melk til vinteren."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/042_a_cow_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Cow of Our Own"
msgstr "Vår egen ku"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/042_a_cow_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With the east meadow, we have room for a cow at last! Buy one at the horse farm in Torsgården. A "
"cow is big, but she fits in your boat like a crate, if she stands still."
msgstr ""
"Med østengen har vi endelig plass til ei ku! Kjøp ei på hestegården på Torsgården. Ei ku er stor, "
"men hun får plass i båten som en kasse, hvis hun står stille."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/042_a_cow_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Look at her big brown eyes! She will give us milk every day. Let us call her Rosa."
msgstr "Se de store brune øynene hennes! Hun gir oss melk hver dag. La oss kalle henne Rosa."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/042_a_cow_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cows were the wealth of a farm: a family counted its riches in cows."
msgstr "Kuene var gårdens rikdom: en familie regnet formuen sin i kyr."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/043_pots_for_ekvik/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Pots for Ekvik"
msgstr "Krukker til Ekvik"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/043_pots_for_ekvik/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The fish soup! We cook it for the whole village, but our big pot cracked. Bring us three crates of"
" pots from the potter, please."
msgstr ""
"Fiskesuppa! Vi koker den til hele bygda, men den store gryta vår har sprukket. Ta med tre kasser "
"krukker fra pottemakeren, er {crew|du|du|dere} snill{crew|||e}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/043_pots_for_ekvik/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "New pots! Tonight there is fish soup for everybody, and for you two the first bowl."
msgstr ""
"Nye krukker! I kveld blir det fiskesuppe til alle, og {crew|du|du|dere} får den første bollen."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/043_pots_for_ekvik/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The cooking pot hung over the fire on a chain, and the soup simmered all day."
msgstr "Gryta hang over ilden i en kjetting, og suppa småkokte hele dagen."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/044_ragnas_broken_oar/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ragna's Broken Oar"
msgstr "Ragnas brukne åre"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/044_ragnas_broken_oar/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Ragna rowed out at dawn and is not back! I fear her oar broke. Find her on the lakes, then come "
"back and fetch the spare oar for her."
msgstr ""
"Ragna rodde ut i daggryet og har ikke kommet tilbake! Jeg er redd åra hennes brakk. Finn henne på "
"innsjøene, og kom så tilbake og hent reserveåra til henne."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/044_ragnas_broken_oar/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hello! Yes, my oar broke, and I drift with one. Tell Tor to give you the spare one!"
msgstr ""
"Hei! Ja, åra mi brakk, og jeg driver rundt med bare én. Si til Tor at han skal gi "
"{crew|deg|deg|dere} reserveåra!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/044_ragnas_broken_oar/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "She is well? Thank the gods. Here is the oar: bring it to her!"
msgstr "Står det bra til med henne? Gudene være takket. Her er åra: ta den med til henne!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/044_ragnas_broken_oar/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My oar! Now I can row again. Here, take some fish: the freshest on the lakes."
msgstr "Åra mi! Nå kan jeg ro igjen. Her, ta litt fisk: den ferskeste på innsjøene."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/044_ragnas_broken_oar/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Every viking boat carried spare oars: a broken oar was common."
msgstr "Alle vikingbåter hadde reserveårer med: det var vanlig at en åre brakk."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/045_torches_for_the_dark/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Torches for the Dark"
msgstr "Fakler mot mørket"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/045_torches_for_the_dark/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The nights grow long. The guests of the autumn feast need light: bring me tar for torches, two "
"pots from Ekvik, and two crates of flax for the wicks."
msgstr ""
"Nettene blir lange. Gjestene på høstfesten trenger lys: ta med tjære til fakler, to krukker fra "
"Ekvik, og to kasser lin til veker."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/045_torches_for_the_dark/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tar for torches? They burn bright and long."
msgstr "Tjære til fakler? De brenner lyst og lenge."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/045_torches_for_the_dark/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tar and flax: now my torches will light up the whole bay!"
msgstr "Tjære og lin: nå lyser faklene mine opp hele bukta!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/045_torches_for_the_dark/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Viking torches were sticks wrapped in flax or cloth, soaked in tar or fat."
msgstr "Vikingfaklene var pinner surret inn i lin eller tøy, dyppet i tjære eller fett."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/046_the_autumn_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Autumn Feast"
msgstr "Høstfesten"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/046_the_autumn_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The autumn feast is tomorrow! Knut's ale is ready, five barrels. Bring them from Lindtorp, and "
"bring three crates of fish for the soup too."
msgstr ""
"Høstfesten er i morgen! Ølet til Knut er klart, fem tønner. Hent dem i Lindtorp, og ta med tre "
"kasser fisk til suppa også."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/046_the_autumn_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The ale! Now the fish."
msgstr "Ølet! Nå fisken."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/046_the_autumn_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The biggest batch I ever brewed! Five barrels for Orm."
msgstr "Det største brygget jeg noen gang har laget! Fem tønner til Orm."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/046_the_autumn_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ale, soup, torches, Sten's flute and Hrafn's knives! Everybody is here. Dance with us!"
msgstr "Øl, suppe, fakler, fløyta til Sten og knivene til Hrafn! Alle er her. Dans med oss!"

