#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/064_the_ferrymans_last_trip/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Old Halvard says his bones are too old for the oars. He wants to live with his daughter in Solby. "
"Will you row him there? He has stories for the whole way."
