"Gamle Halvard sier at knoklene hans er for gamle til årene. Han vil bo hos datteren sin i Solby. "
"Vil {crew|du|du|dere} ro ham dit? Han har historier for hele veien."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/064_the_ferrymans_last_trip/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Father! Come in, your chair by the fire is ready. Thank you for bringing him."
