#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/064_the_ferrymans_last_trip/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Old Halvard: Two young skippers for an old ferryman! Did I ever tell you about the sea serpent?"
msgstr ""
"Gamle Halvard: {crew|En ung skipper|En ung skipper|To unge skippere} for en gammel ferjemann! Har "
"jeg noen gang fortalt om sjøormen?"

