#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/065_shearing_time/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The sheep are shorn! Nine sacks of fleece for Sæunn the weaver. Nine are more than your boat "
"takes: two trips, or a clever packing."
msgstr ""
"Sauene er klipt! Ni sekker ull til veversken Sæunn. Ni er mer enn båten {crew|din|din|deres} tar: "
"to turer, eller lur pakking."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/065_shearing_time/mission.json
