#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I want a brooch like a dragon! Hrafn makes it, if he gets glass beads for the eyes from the "
"market. And it costs 15 silver: I have saved them."
msgstr ""
"Jeg vil ha ei nål formet som en drage! Hrafn lager den, hvis han får glassperler til øynene fra "
"markedet. Og den koster 15 sølv: dem har jeg spart."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Green eyes for a dragon. Come back tomorrow."
msgstr "Grønne øyne til en drage. Kom tilbake i morgen."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Green glass beads, from very far away. Small, but precious!"
msgstr "Grønne glassperler, fra langt, langt borte. Små, men kostbare!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "It is beautiful! Here, Father gave me 30 silver for you, and two are extra."
msgstr "Den er nydelig! Her, far ga meg 30 sølv til {crew|deg|deg|dere}, og to av dem er ekstra."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A dragon with green eyes, biting its tail. Careful, the pin is sharp!"
msgstr "En drage med grønne øyne som biter seg i halen. Forsiktig, nåla er skarp!"

