#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Sunny Hill"
msgstr "Den solrike bakken"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My old aunt Gerd moves to Solby, to her sister. She owns the sunny hill by your farm, and says: "
"whoever rows me and my chests gets the hill! She has three chests."
msgstr ""
"Gamle tante Gerd flytter til Solby, til søsteren sin. Hun eier den solrike bakken ved gården "
"{crew|din|din|deres}, og sier: den som ror meg og kistene mine, får bakken! Hun har tre kister."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Aunt Gerd's chests? Bring her too!"
msgstr "Kistene til tante Gerd? Ta henne med også!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Aunt Gerd: My chests! Careful, the blue one has my grandmother's spoons."
msgstr "Tante Gerd: Kistene mine! Forsiktig, den blå har skjeene til bestemoren min."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My sister! And my chests! You are good girls. The sunny hill is yours: plant something beautiful "
"on it."
msgstr ""
"Søsteren min! Og kistene mine! {crew|Du er en snill gutt|Du er ei snill jente|Dere er snille "
"barn|Dere er snille jenter}. Den solrike bakken er {crew|din|din|deres}: plant noe vakkert der."

