#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/072_a_flock_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The sunny hill has the best grass. Let us have a real flock: five sheep! Buy them at the market or"
" from Sten's herders."
msgstr ""
"Den solrike bakken har det beste gresset. La oss få en ordentlig flokk: fem sauer! Kjøp dem på "
"markedet eller av gjeterne til Sten."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/072_a_flock_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Five sheep on the hill, like white clouds. We will have wool for the whole family!"
msgstr "Fem sauer på bakken, som hvite skyer. Vi får ull til hele familien!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/072_a_flock_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sheep gave wool, milk, meat and skins; nothing was wasted."
msgstr "Sauene ga ull, melk, kjøtt og skinn; ingenting gikk til spille."

