#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You are ready. Do my round alone today: look at the lambs in Ålberga, the horses in Torsgården and"
" the swans in Svanetorp. Then come and tell me."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Du|Du|Dere} er klar{crew|||e}. Gå runden min alene i dag: se til lammene i Ålberga, hestene "
"på Torsgården og svanene i Svanetorp. Kom så og fortell meg."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "You look in their eyes, their ears, their hooves... All well? Good! They like you."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Du|Du|Dere} ser i øynene, ørene og hovene deres... Alt bra? Fint! De liker "
"{crew|deg|deg|dere}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bror is old, but well. Silke's new foal is strong. Tell Tova all is fine."
msgstr "Bror er gammel, men frisk. Det nye føllet til Silke er sterkt. Si til Tova at alt er bra."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The swans? Fat and happy. One has a sore wing: you wrapped it well."
