#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Autumn again! Before the lakes freeze, fill the store: ten crates of hay and six of grain, within "
"three days. You know how by now!"
msgstr ""
"Høst igjen! Før sjøene fryser, fyll lageret: ti kasser høy og seks kasser korn, innen tre dager. "
"Nå vet {crew|du|du|dere} hvordan!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay for all our animals. Now the grain."
msgstr "Høy til alle dyrene våre. Nå kornet."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The store is full to the roof! Not one animal will be hungry this winter."
msgstr "Lageret er fullt til taket! Ikke ett dyr blir sultent denne vinteren."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Autumn was the busiest time: everything for the long winter had to be in."
msgstr "Høsten var den travleste tiden: alt til den lange vinteren måtte i hus."

